        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>井上雄彦 后记（三栏）</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 18px 14px;\n    background: #efece4;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    color: #1b1b1b;\n  }\n  .page {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: row;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 26px;\n    max-width: 1040px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .col {\n    flex: 1 1 0;\n    min-width: 0;\n    background: #f6f4ec;\n    padding: 8px 10px 14px 10px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .col-2 {\n    background: #f4f2ea;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border: 1px dashed #8a8a8a;\n    background: #e2e0d8;\n    color: #4a4a4a;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n  .ph-photostrip {\n    width: 150px;\n    height: 200px;\n    margin: 4px auto 10px auto;\n  }\n  .ph-film {\n    width: 120px;\n    height: 205px;\n    margin: 4px auto 10px auto;\n  }\n  .ph-portrait {\n    width: 150px;\n    height: 205px;\n    margin: 4px auto 10px auto;\n  }\n  .name {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.45em;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    padding-right: 0.45em;\n  }\n  .body-text p {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .body-text p.last {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"col col-1\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder ph-photostrip\">[Photo grid: four black-and-white portrait snapshots of a young man, 2×2 arrangement, top of left column]</div>\n    <p class=\"name\">井 上 雄 彦</p>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>最近，我突然想养只狗。</p>\n      <p>小时候，我非常喜欢猫、狗之类的动物。当得知曾经给街坊的狗随便取名叫\"卡洛\"，觉得它一定很可怜。我现在的街坊也养着一只大狗，名字叫\"银次\"。当我从隔着差不多跟我一般高的院墙外喊\"银次\"的时候，它便会伸出大大的脑袋，并把两只大大的前爪搭在院墙上，[illegible]我。</p>\n      <p class=\"last\">每当这时，我就想如果自己养一只大狗该多好啊。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"col col-2\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder ph-film\">[Illustration: red line drawing of a face on white, framed by black film-strip sprocket borders, top of center column]</div>\n    <p class=\"name\">井 上 雄 彦</p>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>刚开始画\"灌篮高手\"时的愿望，如今已经实现了两个。</p>\n      <p>一个是以采访为名去在美国观看 NBA 的决赛。另一个也是以采访为名，让在巴塞罗那现场观看奥运会。</p>\n      <p class=\"last\">下一个愿望是希望能看到日本篮球队获得奥运会的出线权。那些少年读者曾经在来信中写到\"自从我看了《灌篮高手》后就开始打篮球了\"。如果这些孩子们长大之后能实现我的梦想的话……那一定会激动得放声大哭……</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"col col-3\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder ph-portrait\">[Photo: colour portrait of a young man, with KODAK 5028 film edge markings along the left side, top of right column]</div>\n    <p class=\"name\">井 上 雄 彦</p>\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>多亏大家的支持，《灌篮高手》才能出版第 10 卷，衷心感谢各位读者朋友。</p>\n      <p>自开始连载已经过去两年了，然而故事中才刚过了两个月。如果连载了两年才过两个月的话，那樱木他们升高二的时候岂不是还要等 12 年，到他们毕业的话，还要等 36 年……</p>\n      <p class=\"last\">我想不会的……</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
